@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-25 - Create New Product

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Products UI" as FE
control "ShoesController" as API
control "ShoesService" as Service
database "MongoDB: shoes, shoesDetail, counters" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-25
FE -> API: POST /shoes/product
API -> Service: Execute Create New Product
Service -> DB: Read/write shoes, shoesDetail, counters
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Sản phẩm xuất hiện trên store

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: Stock = 0 cho tất cả sizes -> sản phẩm hidden
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đã đăng nhập với role admin
Post: Sản phẩm xuất hiện trên store
Main flow:
1. Admin vào /admin/products
2. Admin bấm Add Product
3. Admin nhập: name, category, productType, collection, base price
4. Admin thêm color variants: colorName, hex code, thumbnail, images, sizes\n+ stock, styleCode, description, materialNote, origin
5. Admin bấm Create
6. System gọi API POST /shoes/product
7. System lưu shoes + shoesDetail vào DB
end note
@enduml
